 "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "450112": {"id": 450112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|OTs14|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "450121": {"id": 450121, "motion_name": "motions/scene_1.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"450101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "450102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "450103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "450104": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "What do you have planned today? Let's hear it."}, "450105": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "MOOD1", "caption": ""}, "450106": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "What a nice atmosphere. Shall we play some fitting music to go alongside it?"}, "450107": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "BUILDOVER", "caption": "New friends? This calls for a cup."}, "450108": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "Let me guess... Judging from your expression, you're not here to talk about work."}, "450109": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "What do you want to eat tonight? How does letting me cook again tonight sound? It's no trouble at all, and we did have fun the past several times."}, "450110": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "This is...for me? I already knew that this would happen.<>All of what you've suffered and endured so far, I've seen it with my own two eyes.<>Commander, you are the one that I have deemed to be worthy of my trust and belief, so let us stay side-by-side together forever."}, "450111": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": "Huh!?"}, "450112": {"char_code": "OTs14", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Come, don't be so stiff, start by helping me make a cup of tea."}, "450121": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}}}